  "bio": "Taz Maya is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Montigny-lès-Metz, France, renowned for their expertise in fineline, geometric, and minimalist tattoo designs. With a keen eye for detail, Taz specializes in the precise and intricate art of microrealism and dotwork, ensuring each piece is a masterpiece of clean and refined lines. Dedicated to providing a safe and inclusive environment for all clients, Taz upholds the highest standards of professionalism in their craft."
